Ever find a snake or spider obviously move under say a food ration
and become invisible (on the screen)?  Then you move to attack and
the game specifically acts as though you just discovered the monster.
With the separate key strokes for moving versus fighting, this annoying
distinction would no longer occur.  Yet another vote (even though it
does not move the development team :-) ) for separate moving versus
fighting commands.
